{"c":"421066","n":"STUDENSKÝ POTOK 1","t":"M","s":"JČ","o":"Studená","url":"421066-studensky-potok-1","stav":"2026-10-06","popis":"Přítok Nežárky – Lužnice. Od tabule hranice revíru (50 m od Hornomezi- říčského rybníka) až k pramenům. K revíru patří Dvorecký potok od mostu v Nouzově až k pramenům a nádrž:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nPodleský rybník\tv k. ú. Studená\t2,5 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n(GPS 49°11'28.419\"N, 15°17'4.768\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nRybníky ležící na toku Dvoreckého a Studenského potoka do revíru nepatří, včetně zájezku u Svobodova mlýna v k. ú. Zahrádky. Na Podleském rybníku je nejmenší lovná míra kapra zvýšena na 45 cm. Jelec jesen a mník jednovousý jsou celoročně hájeni.","delka":16,"rozloha":6,"lat":49.190547,"lon":15.283494,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/studena","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"studena@mo.jcus.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":45,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":40,"max":null,"hajen"